-| --- | ---
-| `cfra-base` | None 
-| `cfra-incr` | Incremental + trivial operations
-| `cfra-incr-lazy` | Incremental + trivial operations + lazy add
-| `fm-base` | None
-| `fm-incr-triv` | Incremental + trivial operations
-| `fm-incr-triv-lazy` | Incremental + trivial operations + lazy add
